WEBVTT

01:29.440 --> 01:34.330
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.830 --> 01:37.789
[Episode 1]

02:08.680 --> 02:09.520
Lu Xixiao,

02:10.570 --> 02:11.530
I'm sorry.

02:12.560 --> 02:13.630
I didn't mean it.

02:14.910 --> 02:15.750
I told you, don't ever

02:15.750 --> 02:17.550
let me see you again in this life.

02:18.400 --> 02:19.310
Otherwise, I'll make you

02:19.310 --> 02:20.190
beg me in tears.

02:22.500 --> 02:24.160
I have forgotten many things.

02:24.440 --> 02:26.240
You should forget them soon too.

02:31.370 --> 02:32.960
What gives you the right to stand here

02:32.960 --> 02:34.960
acting like you're the wronged one?

02:35.550 --> 02:37.310
No matter how you spin
what happened back then,

02:37.310 --> 02:39.280
you're the one who let me down.

02:42.420 --> 02:43.190
Zhou Wan,

02:44.460 --> 02:46.460
even if you lie to me a hundred times,

02:47.760 --> 02:49.620
as long as you say you love me once,

02:50.850 --> 02:52.780
I will forgive you for everything.

02:54.470 --> 02:55.430
Lu Xixiao,

02:56.710 --> 02:57.960
if you'd known

02:59.120 --> 02:59.960
10 years ago

02:59.980 --> 03:01.780
how badly I was going to hurt you,

03:03.150 --> 03:05.020
would you still have let me
get close to you?

03:05.020 --> 03:06.980
[2026]

03:07.000 --> 03:08.300
[2016]

03:08.330 --> 03:16.710
[May your hard work pay off
and your name shine on the honor roll.]

03:08.430 --> 03:09.190
Finally,

03:10.190 --> 03:12.120
let's take the pledge together.

03:13.240 --> 03:14.280
In June's exams,

03:14.430 --> 03:16.079
we'll give it everything we've got

03:16.079 --> 03:18.190
and make sure
the first major test of our lives

03:18.190 --> 03:19.650
leaves us with no regrets.

03:20.120 --> 03:20.630
Come on.

03:21.000 --> 03:22.000
Everyone,

03:22.020 --> 03:23.280
raise your arms and repeat after me!

03:23.280 --> 03:24.530
Give it our all!

03:24.710 --> 03:25.800
No regrets!

03:25.460 --> 03:28.750
[Grade 12, Class 1]

03:25.930 --> 03:27.370
Give it our all!

03:27.400 --> 03:28.840
No regrets!

03:28.910 --> 03:30.450
Give it our all!

03:30.480 --> 03:31.880
No regrets!

03:31.900 --> 03:33.530
Give it our all!

03:33.630 --> 03:35.120
No regrets!

03:35.120 --> 03:35.579
Hurry up!

03:35.579 --> 03:36.360
Stop!

03:36.800 --> 03:37.310
Stop!

03:37.380 --> 03:38.329
Stop! Don't run!

03:38.800 --> 03:40.460
Lu Xixiao, what are you doing?

03:42.150 --> 03:44.060
Do you have any sense of discipline?

03:44.060 --> 03:45.380
Well, Mr. Zhao,

03:45.440 --> 03:46.870
could you do something about this?

03:46.870 --> 03:47.470
Do something.

03:47.470 --> 03:48.530
Homeroom teacher!

03:48.950 --> 03:49.810
Mr. Zhao!

03:51.730 --> 03:52.329
Don't run!

04:19.660 --> 04:21.070
[May your hard work pay off
and your name shine on the honor roll.]

04:25.130 --> 04:25.650
Xixiao!

04:40.430 --> 04:43.040
Everyone, stop splashing water!

04:43.270 --> 04:45.270
Lu Xixiao, how dare you come up here?

04:45.500 --> 04:46.500
You are simply...

04:56.790 --> 04:58.390
Teachers, fellow students,

04:58.870 --> 05:00.800
I hope that in this blazing summer,

05:00.800 --> 05:03.630
everyone will thrive

05:04.160 --> 05:05.560
and enjoy great success!

05:06.500 --> 05:07.270
Teachers, fellow students,

05:07.270 --> 05:08.120
I'm sorry, I was wrong.

05:07.290 --> 05:08.850
[May your hard work pay off  and your name shine on the honor roll.]

05:11.400 --> 05:12.310
Lu Xixiao!

05:12.710 --> 05:13.840
Write a self-criticism!

05:13.840 --> 05:14.900
Call your parents!

05:16.210 --> 05:18.430
Everyone, stop splashing water!

05:18.540 --> 05:20.870
Catching a cold will affect your studies.

05:22.210 --> 05:23.900
Security, turn off the water!

05:43.880 --> 05:44.560
Get in here!

05:46.870 --> 05:48.760
You think you're so capable now, right?

05:48.760 --> 05:50.360
While I was out of the office,

05:50.650 --> 05:51.880
you stole things?

05:52.250 --> 05:55.870
[Virtues and Responsibilities]

05:53.010 --> 05:54.070
Explain yourself.

05:54.800 --> 05:55.430
Sir,

05:55.630 --> 05:57.040
that's not fair to say.

05:57.040 --> 05:57.800
How is it not fair?

05:57.800 --> 05:59.070
Xixiao, it's not right.

05:59.070 --> 05:59.870
When Lu Xixiao came to school,

05:59.870 --> 06:00.600
you said he disturbed the students

06:00.600 --> 06:01.480
and suspended him.

06:01.480 --> 06:03.390
Then you made him
attend the morning assembly.

06:03.390 --> 06:04.000
But when he showed up for the assembly,

06:04.000 --> 06:05.310
you didn't even give him a place to stand.

06:05.310 --> 06:06.070
With nowhere to stand,

06:06.070 --> 06:07.600
he had to ride his bike home.

06:07.720 --> 06:09.190
You change your mind constantly.

06:09.190 --> 06:10.120
Isn't that tormenting?

06:10.120 --> 06:12.270
Jiang Fan, you sure have a way with words.

06:12.270 --> 06:13.710
Wasn't it because he was late?

06:13.710 --> 06:14.800
Wasn't that because you

06:14.800 --> 06:15.800
confiscated his motorcycle key?

06:15.800 --> 06:16.770
Doesn't he have legs?

06:16.770 --> 06:17.570
Can't he walk?

06:17.800 --> 06:19.260
He must ride a motorcycle?

06:20.380 --> 06:21.400
Stop scratching your head.

06:21.400 --> 06:22.130
Turn around!

06:22.570 --> 06:23.250
Sir,

06:24.560 --> 06:26.340
don't be jealous of his natural curls.

06:26.340 --> 06:27.090
If he doesn't dry

06:27.090 --> 06:27.830
his natural curls,

06:27.830 --> 06:29.480
it'll be very troublesome later.

06:29.480 --> 06:30.800
Jiang Fan, shut up.

06:31.510 --> 06:32.270
Lu Xixiao,

06:33.000 --> 06:33.750
your family

06:33.750 --> 06:35.100
is well-respected and influential.

06:35.100 --> 06:36.040
And yet you still behave like this.

06:36.040 --> 06:37.950
Sir, don't just scold him.

06:37.980 --> 06:39.040
I was involved too.

06:39.390 --> 06:40.480
Jiang Fan, do you need a lesson?

06:40.480 --> 06:41.430
That's enough, sir.

06:41.430 --> 06:42.659
I'm already 18.

06:43.360 --> 06:44.159
Have you ever seen

06:43.900 --> 06:46.990
[Virtues and Responsibilities]

06:44.159 --> 06:45.690
my family try to control me?

06:46.480 --> 06:48.000
My own family doesn't bother managing me,

06:48.000 --> 06:49.090
so why should you?

06:51.120 --> 06:53.250
Well, that almost sounds reasonable.

06:53.320 --> 06:54.980
So I'm wrong to criticize you?

06:56.450 --> 06:57.710
I... I'll get a tissue.

06:57.720 --> 06:58.860
Don't give me that.

07:01.430 --> 07:04.030
If you want your motorcycle back,
it's simple.

07:04.600 --> 07:07.260
In the citywide high school
mock exam rankings,

07:08.200 --> 07:09.280
not one place below the Top 1,000.

07:09.280 --> 07:10.080
Got it?

07:11.970 --> 07:12.790
Sir,

07:13.240 --> 07:15.070
aren't you making it too hard?

07:15.190 --> 07:16.240
Even if we add our scores together,

07:16.240 --> 07:17.070
we still couldn't make the top 1,000.

07:17.070 --> 07:17.950
I don't care.

07:18.190 --> 07:18.870
I've said everything

07:18.870 --> 07:20.160
nice to you two.

07:20.220 --> 07:22.000
This life is your own.

07:22.430 --> 07:23.070
And your fate

07:23.070 --> 07:24.600
is in your own hands.

07:24.620 --> 07:25.250
Right?

07:26.090 --> 07:27.160
Youth

07:27.190 --> 07:28.450
only lasts a few years.

07:29.240 --> 07:29.830
If you don't

07:29.830 --> 07:31.070
grasp it well,

07:31.390 --> 07:33.050
what will you do with your life

07:33.710 --> 07:34.960
and your future?

07:35.720 --> 07:36.890
After discussion, the school has decided

07:36.890 --> 07:40.070
that today's incident will result in
a disciplinary demerit.

07:40.070 --> 07:41.980
You should learn from the good students.

07:41.980 --> 07:43.909
Learn more from Zhou Wan.

07:44.560 --> 07:45.560
Just look at her.

07:45.640 --> 07:46.500
If the two of you

07:46.870 --> 07:48.330
were even half as sensible as she is,

07:48.330 --> 07:49.470
I'd be more than satisfied.

07:49.470 --> 07:50.150
Zhou Wan,

07:50.600 --> 07:51.830
is this the application form

07:51.830 --> 07:52.640
you submitted?

07:52.640 --> 07:53.350
Take a look.

07:54.950 --> 07:56.190
Just tell me,

07:56.190 --> 07:57.070
didn't I also stand on
the stage this morning?

07:57.070 --> 07:58.360
I know you want me to apply to

07:58.360 --> 08:00.160
a better university out of town,

08:00.160 --> 08:02.290
-but I still want to stay in the city.
-You think standing on that stage

08:02.290 --> 08:03.250
was something to be proud of?

08:03.250 --> 08:04.780
My grandmother is getting old.

08:04.780 --> 08:06.310
I can make my own decisions.

08:08.200 --> 08:09.680
Weren't you being chased by security

08:09.680 --> 08:11.080
for stealing something?

08:11.310 --> 08:12.510
Alright, sir.

08:12.830 --> 08:14.220
Let's stop wasting time.

08:14.220 --> 08:15.260
If I make it to that whatever list...

08:15.260 --> 08:16.390
The top 1,000 list.

08:16.750 --> 08:18.110
If I make it, return my keys.

08:18.110 --> 08:19.810
Not even one spot lower.

08:20.300 --> 08:20.910
Fine.

08:24.830 --> 08:26.590
Don't learn from them.

08:26.720 --> 08:27.310
Can you tell

08:27.310 --> 08:28.980
that Mr. Zhao is two years
younger than me?

08:28.980 --> 08:30.250
He's lost all his hair.

08:30.290 --> 08:30.950
And you,

08:31.120 --> 08:31.730
Jiang Fan.

08:32.080 --> 08:32.960
Thank you, sir.

08:32.960 --> 08:33.890
I'll go back now.

08:33.909 --> 08:34.630
No need to thank me.

08:34.630 --> 08:35.760
Then I'll leave too.

08:36.750 --> 08:37.390
Zhou Wan,

08:37.409 --> 08:38.049
come back.

08:38.370 --> 08:39.900
I have something to ask you.

08:43.960 --> 08:44.510
Lately,

08:44.510 --> 08:45.790
you haven't been tutoring

08:45.790 --> 08:47.450
to make extra money, have you?

08:47.840 --> 08:48.670
Don't lose your scholarship

08:48.670 --> 08:50.360
over this again.

08:50.580 --> 08:51.840
Focus on your studies.

08:52.980 --> 08:53.780
Of course not.

08:53.850 --> 08:55.020
Good. You may go.

09:05.730 --> 09:06.790
My name is Zhou Wan.

09:06.960 --> 09:09.020
"Wan" as in drawing
a bow like a full moon.

09:09.020 --> 09:10.740
I just turned 20 this year.

09:11.060 --> 09:12.120
I'm currently studying at

09:12.120 --> 09:13.980
the city's key Ocean University.

09:14.970 --> 09:16.270
Academically,

09:16.670 --> 09:17.960
I rarely drop out

09:17.960 --> 09:19.140
of the top ten in my grade.

09:19.140 --> 09:19.870
In high school,

09:19.870 --> 09:20.870
I also often represented my school

09:20.870 --> 09:22.090
in various competitions.

09:21.220 --> 09:23.590
[Zhou Wan]

09:22.380 --> 09:23.840
Piano and painting

09:23.630 --> 09:24.450
[Artistic Expertise]

09:23.840 --> 09:25.720
are my little hobbies.

09:26.220 --> 09:26.960
My father

09:26.960 --> 09:28.560
runs a small factory.

09:28.600 --> 09:30.110
My mother helps him out.

09:30.270 --> 09:32.200
I didn't want my parents to work too hard,

09:32.200 --> 09:34.000
so I did a work-study program.

09:35.440 --> 09:36.730
Such a sensible child.

09:36.890 --> 09:38.490
Yes, positive and upbeat.

09:41.870 --> 09:43.080
All of the above

09:43.510 --> 09:44.390
is a lie.

09:44.760 --> 09:46.340
I don't have a happy family.

09:46.920 --> 09:48.150
When I was very young,

09:48.150 --> 09:49.210
my dad passed away.

09:49.630 --> 09:50.670
My mom also left

09:50.690 --> 09:51.820
for her own new life.

09:52.350 --> 09:54.950
Only my grandmother and I
depend on each other.

09:55.640 --> 09:57.420
To pay for my grandmother's medical bills,

09:57.420 --> 09:59.620
I occasionally do some part-time jobs.

09:59.630 --> 10:01.330
As long as it can save my grandmother,

10:01.330 --> 10:02.860
I am willing to do anything.

10:03.440 --> 10:07.160
[Barbecue]

10:03.550 --> 10:05.080
Do you have any other poses?

10:12.110 --> 10:13.410
Can you watch where you're going?

10:13.410 --> 10:14.820
Can't you see we're taking pictures?

10:14.820 --> 10:15.850
Can't you hear me?

10:16.320 --> 10:19.180
Why are you still standing
in the middle of the road?

10:25.550 --> 10:27.210
Isn't that the girl from our grade,

10:27.210 --> 10:28.810
what's her name, Zhou Wan?【】

10:29.380 --> 10:31.040
Why is she dressed so weirdly?

10:33.850 --> 10:35.330
After this summer is over,

10:35.800 --> 10:37.020
I won't need

10:37.400 --> 10:38.860
these disguises anymore.

11:02.920 --> 11:05.120
Who doesn't know how to give a surprise?

11:07.310 --> 11:08.750
You nearly scared me to death.

11:08.750 --> 11:10.510
You nearly scared me to death, Grandma.

11:10.510 --> 11:14.120
Happy birthday to you.

11:14.170 --> 11:16.720
Happy birthday to you.

11:16.750 --> 11:18.040
Every year on my grandmother's birthday,

11:17.070 --> 11:19.050
[Happy Birthday] [Long Life]

11:18.070 --> 11:19.790
my neighbor and childhood friend,

11:19.790 --> 11:21.520
Jiang Yan, celebrates with us.

11:22.720 --> 11:24.200
With my life right now,

11:24.440 --> 11:25.900
I am already very content.

11:33.420 --> 11:34.070
Who is it?

11:36.340 --> 11:37.570
Is it from the school?

11:38.000 --> 11:39.840
Yes, a teacher from school.

11:39.870 --> 11:41.550
The teacher is probably asking her

11:41.550 --> 11:42.630
if she can type out the sample essay,

11:42.630 --> 11:43.020
right?

11:43.020 --> 11:43.510
Yes.

11:43.890 --> 11:45.550
They urged me this afternoon.

11:46.510 --> 11:47.200
Really?

11:48.790 --> 11:50.320
You haven't been doing

11:50.320 --> 11:51.750
anything unnecessary lately, have you?

11:51.750 --> 11:52.750
Of course not.

11:53.820 --> 11:54.660
Alright.

11:54.690 --> 11:56.230
You shouldn't waste your wish.

11:56.230 --> 11:57.130
I'll make one for you.

11:57.130 --> 11:57.940
Okay.

11:58.750 --> 12:00.380
I hope my lies

12:01.030 --> 12:02.460
will never be exposed.

12:02.400 --> 12:05.540
[Big Ocean Motorcycle Workshop]

12:07.970 --> 12:09.360
Xixiao.

12:11.890 --> 12:13.500
Stop playing with Ping's
crappy motorbike.

12:13.500 --> 12:14.430
Have you seen it?

12:14.440 --> 12:16.640
The photos on the forum are going viral.

12:16.950 --> 12:17.370
[I was tired of listening to the
morning meeting.]

12:16.960 --> 12:18.170
Look at all these replies.

12:17.420 --> 12:18.010
[Then it turned into
the drama of the year.]

12:18.020 --> 12:18.700
[Lu Xixiao actually rushed onto the field
in front of the whole school
and grabbed the microphone]

12:18.720 --> 12:19.670
[And somehow turned on the sprinklers,
and the whole playground
ended up raining under the sun.]

12:18.800 --> 12:19.530
See?

12:20.360 --> 12:21.530
Just tell me, does the photo I took of you

12:21.530 --> 12:23.390
next to that Huqing top prospect,

12:23.440 --> 12:24.670
the cold beauty from Yangming,

12:24.670 --> 12:26.030
and Zhou Wan, our grade number two,

12:26.030 --> 12:27.030
have a story vibe?

12:29.480 --> 12:31.410
Do we look like we have a story vibe?

12:31.570 --> 12:32.420
Episode one.

12:34.680 --> 12:35.370
Let me see.

12:38.980 --> 12:41.040
I don't think it really looks like it.

12:41.770 --> 12:42.630
Do you know her?

12:42.970 --> 12:43.770
Not very well.

12:45.220 --> 12:45.960
Jiang Fan!

12:47.720 --> 12:48.640
Ping!

12:48.840 --> 12:49.840
Love you!

12:53.500 --> 12:55.840
-Look. See if there's any problem.
-Handsome.

12:55.840 --> 12:56.960
If there's no problem, just sign it.

12:56.960 --> 12:58.020
Are you terminally ill?

12:58.020 --> 12:59.230
Your dad bought you another one?

12:59.230 --> 13:00.830
You are terminally ill!

13:00.860 --> 13:02.240
I got 118 in math.

13:02.240 --> 13:03.770
My dad gave this to me
as my 18th birthday gift.

13:03.770 --> 13:04.980
What? How much?

13:05.160 --> 13:06.500
118.

13:07.200 --> 13:08.080
Here you are.

13:08.800 --> 13:10.180
Keys.

13:10.300 --> 13:10.850
Here.

13:18.590 --> 13:19.360
Coming.

13:24.720 --> 13:25.320
What are you doing?

13:25.320 --> 13:26.480
How did you get that score?

13:26.480 --> 13:27.440
Just like that.

13:27.440 --> 13:28.560
How?

13:28.590 --> 13:29.880
Normally, of course.

13:30.790 --> 13:31.440
How?

13:32.100 --> 13:33.160
What are you doing?

13:34.400 --> 13:35.070
Are you going to tell me?

13:35.070 --> 13:36.390
Give me the keys.

13:36.750 --> 13:38.250
Tell me how you got that score first.

13:38.250 --> 13:38.960
You won't tell me, right?

13:38.960 --> 13:40.320
I will, I will.

13:41.810 --> 13:42.540
Give it to me.

13:43.120 --> 13:43.670
Tell me.

13:44.270 --> 13:44.910
A classmate

13:44.910 --> 13:46.760
recommended a top student's notes to me.

13:46.760 --> 13:47.910
He said that as long as
you have his notes,

13:47.910 --> 13:49.470
even the dumbest student
can understand everything.

13:49.470 --> 13:50.550
I just studied from those notes

13:50.550 --> 13:52.360
and memorized the key points—
that's how I got such a high score.

13:52.360 --> 13:53.490
50 yuan per subject.

13:54.160 --> 13:55.890
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

13:56.510 --> 13:57.440
How do you buy it?

13:58.120 --> 13:59.810
The transaction process
is very mysterious.

13:59.810 --> 14:00.550
In our school,

14:00.550 --> 14:01.950
they say no one knows his identity,

14:01.950 --> 14:02.750
and no one has ever seen him.

14:02.610 --> 14:07.130
[English corner]

14:03.440 --> 14:04.840
Every transaction happens
at the stationery store

14:04.840 --> 14:06.320
around the corner from the school gate.

14:06.320 --> 14:06.690
You buy a copy of

14:06.690 --> 14:09.550
the latest English Corner magazine
for that month.

14:09.620 --> 14:10.730
Buy a copy for me.

14:10.840 --> 14:12.030
This person also has a rule.

14:12.030 --> 14:13.230
It's super annoying.

14:13.320 --> 14:14.120
Each person can only

14:14.120 --> 14:15.440
buy notes for one subject at a time.

14:15.440 --> 14:17.960
There's also a limit per subject,
and you can't share them.

14:17.960 --> 14:19.000
I actually don't get

14:19.000 --> 14:19.750
what he's thinking.

14:19.750 --> 14:21.120
Why would he pass up so much money?

14:21.120 --> 14:22.120
He's quite smart.

14:22.890 --> 14:24.080
If everyone scores high,

14:24.080 --> 14:25.680
his business wouldn't last.

14:26.010 --> 14:27.270
Do you have his WeChat?

14:27.840 --> 14:28.440
Yes.

14:28.460 --> 14:29.190
Send it to me.

14:29.730 --> 14:31.190
I'm sorry, Huan's mother.

14:31.890 --> 14:34.020
I was just at a Student Union meeting.

14:35.750 --> 14:36.350
Yes.

14:37.160 --> 14:38.760
College is just really busy.

14:43.420 --> 14:44.380
Really?

14:45.980 --> 14:47.710
Can I start tutoring next week?

14:48.320 --> 14:49.120
That's great.

14:49.720 --> 14:51.450
I'll be there on time next week.

14:51.670 --> 14:52.930
Thank you, Huan's mom.

14:59.670 --> 15:00.270
It's done?

15:01.960 --> 15:03.620
You really live up to
being a recommended student.

15:03.620 --> 15:05.220
You have such a wide network.

15:05.320 --> 15:06.150
Thanks to you.

15:05.690 --> 15:08.870
[Private tutoring: 300 per month]

15:06.390 --> 15:08.450
Now I've got money for medical bills.

15:10.390 --> 15:11.150
You could've also gotten

15:11.150 --> 15:12.480
guaranteed admission.

15:12.750 --> 15:14.040
I've already made up my mind about this.

15:14.040 --> 15:15.100
No need to say more.

15:17.020 --> 15:18.820
I just want to have a good summer.

15:19.870 --> 15:20.870
It's that simple.

15:31.890 --> 15:33.310
When I get into college,

15:33.450 --> 15:34.630
I'll be able to openly

15:34.630 --> 15:35.490
go out and work.

15:36.100 --> 15:37.030
Then Grandma

15:37.050 --> 15:38.510
won't have to work so hard.

15:38.810 --> 15:40.240
And I won't have to lie anymore

15:40.240 --> 15:41.440
about selling notes.

15:42.200 --> 15:42.960
Things will get

15:42.960 --> 15:44.000
better day by day.

15:45.460 --> 15:47.060
Are you still selling notes?

15:48.580 --> 15:50.310
Every little bit saved counts.

15:51.030 --> 15:52.430
I need to save more money.

15:52.540 --> 15:54.700
[Touch the profile picture
and exchange accounts.]

15:57.340 --> 15:58.100
[Chemistry Group]

15:58.120 --> 15:58.940
[Physics exclusive]

15:58.970 --> 15:59.630
[Study group]

15:59.650 --> 16:01.600
[Please pass as soon as possible.
Thank you.]

16:05.180 --> 16:06.510
Why did that guy add you?

16:09.400 --> 16:11.270
Maybe he wants to buy notes too.

16:13.970 --> 16:16.030
But with someone as dangerous as him,

16:16.810 --> 16:17.670
it's better not to

16:17.670 --> 16:18.720
do this business.

16:20.250 --> 16:22.820
[I won't sell them to Lu Xixiao.]

16:23.110 --> 16:24.970
[Sending]

17:02.240 --> 17:03.700
Watch where you're going!

17:03.720 --> 17:04.990
Can't you see we're taking pictures?

17:04.990 --> 17:05.990
Can't you hear me?

17:06.010 --> 17:08.869
Why are you still standing
in the middle of the road?

17:11.670 --> 17:13.710
Isn't that Zhou Wan from our grade?

17:30.370 --> 17:31.630
I won't sell to Lu Xixiao.

17:30.700 --> 17:31.540
[Friend request rejected:
I won't sell them to Lu Xixiao.]

17:41.430 --> 17:42.460
Where is the newsstand

17:42.460 --> 17:43.320
you mentioned?

17:53.190 --> 17:54.050
This is the one.

17:59.480 --> 18:01.880
Boss, the eleventh copy of English Corner.

18:02.160 --> 18:03.290
What eleventh copy?

18:03.710 --> 18:04.910
What English Corner?

18:04.940 --> 18:06.670
I don't have those things here.

18:06.950 --> 18:08.470
Wait, I just bought one last week.

18:08.470 --> 18:09.880
What did you buy last week?

18:09.880 --> 18:10.750
I've never sold that here.

18:10.750 --> 18:11.480
Hurry up and leave.

18:11.480 --> 18:12.640
You bad students.

18:12.680 --> 18:14.050
Bad students only know
how to frame people.

18:14.050 --> 18:15.050
We are honest people.

18:14.740 --> 18:19.330
[Zilin Stationary]

18:15.350 --> 18:16.400
Stop talking nonsense.

18:16.400 --> 18:17.110
I'm warning you.

18:17.110 --> 18:18.040
Leave right now.

18:18.400 --> 18:19.000
Wait.

18:21.350 --> 18:21.840
I...

18:27.720 --> 18:29.030
I really bought it here last week.

18:29.030 --> 18:29.680
Really.

18:30.110 --> 18:31.000
That Mr. Bow.

18:31.160 --> 18:31.640
Bow

18:31.640 --> 18:32.600
told me it was

18:32.720 --> 18:34.350
the eleventh copy of English Corner.

18:34.350 --> 18:35.030
Look.

18:35.960 --> 18:37.060
[Suspended publication]

18:37.550 --> 18:38.950
Suspended publication?

18:43.050 --> 18:44.510
You really can't blame me.

18:47.010 --> 18:48.410
Targeting me, huh?

18:50.350 --> 18:50.720
[Suspended publication]

18:50.720 --> 18:51.800
[Mr. Bow]

18:51.740 --> 18:53.100
There's only this one Moments post.

18:53.100 --> 18:53.750
There's nothing else.

18:53.750 --> 18:55.080
What are you looking at?

18:55.670 --> 18:57.070
I've seen this tree before.

18:57.070 --> 18:57.930
You've seen it?

19:00.180 --> 19:01.710
Don't all trees in the world

19:01.800 --> 19:02.900
look like this?

19:05.050 --> 19:06.940
Come find me after evening study.

19:07.860 --> 19:11.580
[Zilin Stationary]

19:09.190 --> 19:10.790
Then where are you going now?

19:17.130 --> 19:18.990
What does finding the tree prove?

19:21.170 --> 19:21.980
No one comes to this place

19:21.980 --> 19:23.660
even during the day.

19:24.960 --> 19:25.680
And his photo

19:25.680 --> 19:26.740
was taken at night.

19:27.390 --> 19:28.520
What does that mean?

19:28.860 --> 19:30.520
He skips classes just like us.

19:31.400 --> 19:32.920
It means he doesn't have to
attend evening study sessions.

19:32.920 --> 19:33.880
Someone who makes notes like this

19:33.880 --> 19:35.540
couldn't possibly be like us.

19:36.610 --> 19:37.640
It can only be because

19:37.640 --> 19:38.640
his grades are so good that

19:38.640 --> 19:40.570
he has free time to wander around.

19:44.210 --> 19:45.900
In other words,

19:48.460 --> 19:49.110
he is very likely

19:49.110 --> 19:50.000
here right now.

19:50.380 --> 19:51.140
Where?

20:00.000 --> 20:01.410
It's too dark over there.

20:02.920 --> 20:04.250
I have night blindness.

20:05.990 --> 20:06.640
Xixiao.

20:08.160 --> 20:08.920
Xixiao!

20:11.100 --> 20:11.690
Xixiao!

20:13.400 --> 20:14.400
Where are you?

20:19.920 --> 20:21.310
Wait for me here.

20:21.950 --> 20:23.560
Okay. Come back quickly.

20:35.850 --> 20:39.160
[Welcome]

21:57.410 --> 21:58.370
Mr. Bow.

21:59.570 --> 22:00.400
Zhou Wan?

22:01.730 --> 22:02.540
So it's you.

22:11.800 --> 22:14.000
Like a fully drawn bow ready to release—

22:17.910 --> 22:19.510
so you're the drawn bow, huh?

22:22.580 --> 22:23.580
Give it back to me.

22:25.490 --> 22:26.550
That's mine.

22:26.580 --> 22:27.340
So what?

22:27.750 --> 22:28.800
Why do you have it?

22:35.710 --> 22:36.510
Give it back.

22:48.250 --> 22:50.180
I heard you're second in the grade.

22:51.890 --> 22:53.690
You do this kind of business too?

22:57.570 --> 22:58.640
Stay away from me.

23:01.490 --> 23:02.240
What I do

23:02.240 --> 23:03.640
is none of your business.

23:15.380 --> 23:16.880
What exactly do you want?

23:16.880 --> 23:17.640
Give it back.

23:17.640 --> 23:19.350
I'm the one asking you now.

23:21.070 --> 23:22.470
You're quite something.

23:23.280 --> 23:24.810
You really know how to find a spot.

23:24.810 --> 23:27.410
And you love making money
off your classmates.

23:27.790 --> 23:28.680
I don't steal or rob.

23:28.680 --> 23:29.530
I make money with my own skills.

23:29.530 --> 23:30.480
Is there a problem?

23:30.480 --> 23:31.440
Give it back to me.

23:31.440 --> 23:32.120
No problem.

23:33.240 --> 23:34.840
But why are you targeting me?

23:35.070 --> 23:36.070
Did I offend you?

23:38.120 --> 23:39.220
You are too flashy.

23:39.590 --> 23:40.850
It's bad for business.

23:49.850 --> 23:50.960
It's right here.

23:54.290 --> 23:55.710
You're playing with me?

24:05.640 --> 24:08.350
-Wait, what's up?
-You have to give me your notes now.

24:08.350 --> 24:09.880
I'm not trying to take advantage of you.

24:09.880 --> 24:10.800
I will pay you.

24:11.480 --> 24:12.000
Or else...

24:12.000 --> 24:13.400
Or else you'll report me?

24:19.020 --> 24:20.880
You can tell everyone if you want.

24:21.000 --> 24:22.510
But first, you have no proof.

24:22.510 --> 24:23.970
Second, you are Lu Xixiao.

24:24.680 --> 24:25.940
Who would believe you?

24:27.880 --> 24:28.640
Director!

24:28.720 --> 24:29.750
I... I really don't know

24:29.750 --> 24:30.480
where he is.

24:30.480 --> 24:31.400
Why are you yelling?

24:31.400 --> 24:32.160
My ears hurt!

24:32.160 --> 24:33.590
There is no one here.

24:33.610 --> 24:35.790
-What are we doing here?
-Let me ask you,

24:35.790 --> 24:36.750
did you all plan together

24:36.750 --> 24:37.640
to skip evening self-study?

24:37.640 --> 24:38.680
We didn't skip evening study.

24:38.680 --> 24:40.340
Look, there's no one here.

24:52.880 --> 24:53.480
It's creepy.

24:53.480 --> 24:54.030
I'm leaving first, Director.

24:54.030 --> 24:55.230
Come here. Come back.

25:00.790 --> 25:01.310
I...

25:02.840 --> 25:03.640
I'm telling you.

25:03.640 --> 25:04.510
My glasses!

25:04.510 --> 25:05.410
My glasses!

25:06.000 --> 25:06.970
Jiang Fan!

25:07.030 --> 25:08.030
Wait for me!

25:24.030 --> 25:25.290
You're quite capable.

25:25.380 --> 25:26.640
None of your business.

25:34.600 --> 25:35.800
I want the notes.

25:36.860 --> 25:37.780
I told you—

25:38.050 --> 25:40.310
I don't do business with troublemakers.

25:42.650 --> 25:44.180
Don't tell anyone I saw you.

25:54.760 --> 25:55.550
[Exercise Book]

26:05.020 --> 26:06.620
[Grade 12, Class 1]

26:14.620 --> 26:16.560
I'm doomed.

26:17.740 --> 26:19.430
I'm really doomed.

26:19.450 --> 26:20.540
What's your score?

26:20.710 --> 26:21.840
92!

26:23.120 --> 26:24.110
I couldn't get

26:24.110 --> 26:25.160
his chemistry notes last time.

26:25.160 --> 26:26.750
He's out of business again this time.

26:26.750 --> 26:28.540
What am I going to do with my mock exam?

26:28.540 --> 26:29.670
Look at this.

26:29.700 --> 26:30.790
I got it from

26:30.790 --> 26:31.510
the class next door.

26:31.510 --> 26:33.510
Don't show it to anyone else.

26:33.510 --> 26:34.660
Notes?

26:37.530 --> 26:39.580
Didn't he say
he wouldn't release them this time?

26:39.580 --> 26:40.420
I don't know.

26:40.440 --> 26:41.730
A lot of people have it.

26:41.890 --> 26:42.750
Give it to me.

26:42.770 --> 26:43.400
Let me see.

26:43.400 --> 26:44.030
Beg me.

26:44.050 --> 26:44.830
Please.

26:45.500 --> 26:46.410
Keep it a secret.

26:46.410 --> 26:47.000
Quick.

26:47.460 --> 26:48.520
Hurry.

27:03.160 --> 27:04.070
Lu Xixiao!

27:04.440 --> 27:05.500
What are you doing?

27:06.270 --> 27:06.920
-Let's go.
-Mr. Zhao,

27:06.920 --> 27:08.680
I really studied by myself.

27:08.680 --> 27:09.400
Don't I know

27:09.400 --> 27:10.930
what kind of person you are?

27:14.910 --> 27:17.860
[Math Weekly Test Paper]

27:17.010 --> 27:19.270
You did pretty well on the exam this time.

27:20.400 --> 27:21.610
Okay, come on.

27:22.570 --> 27:24.700
Do the math paper again.

27:24.730 --> 27:26.590
Question one, what's the answer?

27:26.740 --> 27:27.460
C.

27:29.040 --> 27:29.840
Question two.

27:30.090 --> 27:30.620
D.

27:31.890 --> 27:32.560
Question three.

27:32.560 --> 27:33.880
C-D-A-B-B-C-B.

27:37.010 --> 27:38.880
You memorized the math answers quite well.

27:38.880 --> 27:40.080
I'm even better at English.

27:40.080 --> 27:41.710
Okay, come on. English.

27:40.610 --> 27:43.080
[Virtues and Responsibilities]

27:43.030 --> 27:43.510
Come on.

27:43.640 --> 27:45.320
Yes, I memorized all the answers,

27:45.320 --> 27:46.990
but you wouldn't understand,

27:47.010 --> 27:47.730
right?

27:52.560 --> 27:53.460
Reporting, sir.

27:53.460 --> 27:54.980
Okay, very good.

27:58.440 --> 27:59.570
Very good.

27:58.750 --> 28:00.960
[Virtues and Responsibilities]

28:02.090 --> 28:02.850
Sir.

28:03.830 --> 28:05.000
You still have the nerve to laugh,

28:05.000 --> 28:05.600
don't you?

28:05.750 --> 28:06.400
I...

28:07.600 --> 28:08.550
I, I, I...

28:08.940 --> 28:10.330
I want to talk to you about something,

28:10.330 --> 28:10.930
Lu Xixiao.

28:11.770 --> 28:12.590
I heard recently

28:12.590 --> 28:13.720
that here in school,

28:13.820 --> 28:15.670
someone is selling study materials,

28:15.670 --> 28:16.870
and someone reported

28:16.960 --> 28:17.920
that it was you.

28:18.110 --> 28:18.880
Am I right?

28:19.160 --> 28:19.770
Is it true?

28:22.320 --> 28:23.180
I'm asking you.

28:23.480 --> 28:24.640
Don't just ask me.

28:24.640 --> 28:25.160
Ask her.

28:25.160 --> 28:26.180
What if she bought them too?

28:26.180 --> 28:27.070
Get over here!

28:27.290 --> 28:28.750
Why are you bothering her?

28:28.790 --> 28:30.790
Zhou Wan is second in the grade.

28:31.130 --> 28:31.880
She might sell materials,

28:31.880 --> 28:33.280
but she'd never buy them.

28:33.570 --> 28:34.370
Get back here.

28:35.070 --> 28:35.790
Come back!

28:41.890 --> 28:42.750
Tell the truth.

28:43.230 --> 28:43.780
Where did they come from?

28:43.780 --> 28:44.980
My tutor gave it to me.

28:45.600 --> 28:46.320
What?

28:46.740 --> 28:48.160
My family hired a tutor

28:48.160 --> 28:49.510
who made some good study materials for me.

28:49.510 --> 28:50.270
I brought them to school

28:50.270 --> 28:51.470
to share with my classmates.

28:51.470 --> 28:53.310
Which of these violates the school rules?

28:53.310 --> 28:54.510
Are you saying this test paper

28:54.510 --> 28:55.920
was made by your tutor?

28:55.990 --> 28:56.560
Yes.

28:56.920 --> 28:58.270
Didn't you say that if I study hard,

28:58.270 --> 28:59.600
you'd give my bike back?

28:59.740 --> 29:00.800
I'm studying hard.

29:00.880 --> 29:02.210
Why are you scolding me?

29:03.540 --> 29:05.090
That's a very good reason.

29:07.160 --> 29:08.290
Thank you, Mr. Zhao.

29:12.200 --> 29:12.810
Okay.

29:17.280 --> 29:18.410
Thank you, teacher.

29:18.590 --> 29:19.260
You can go.

29:23.910 --> 29:24.880
Tutors nowadays

29:24.880 --> 29:26.340
can even make test papers.

29:26.560 --> 29:31.990
[Teacher's Office]

29:30.440 --> 29:31.030
Zhao,

29:31.440 --> 29:32.790
-you taught your students.
-You scared me.

29:32.790 --> 29:34.920
why drag Zhou Wan from my class into it?

29:39.610 --> 29:40.830
If you speak,

29:40.850 --> 29:42.180
you're threatening me.

29:42.340 --> 29:43.800
If the director finds out,

29:44.030 --> 29:45.770
who do you think he'll stand up for?

29:45.770 --> 29:47.870
You're quite vicious.

29:48.680 --> 29:49.940
I'm not as cruel as you—

29:50.190 --> 29:52.200
cutting off people's source of income.

29:52.200 --> 29:53.400
Isn't it because

29:53.400 --> 29:55.200
you treated your customers
differently first?

29:55.200 --> 29:57.860
It's you who caused trouble
and drew attention.

29:58.420 --> 29:59.490
I'm just unlucky.

30:15.800 --> 30:17.310
Well, now I'm the only one who can buy it.

30:17.310 --> 30:18.910
Are you still selling or not?

30:24.020 --> 30:25.020
Double the price.

30:26.670 --> 30:28.030
Are you robbing me?

30:33.230 --> 30:34.430
I need it by tomorrow.

30:36.030 --> 30:37.030
Just this once.

31:03.070 --> 31:06.400
Big spender.

31:09.840 --> 31:11.170
The big spender is here.

31:12.800 --> 31:14.610
Didn't I say to text me
if there's something,

31:14.610 --> 31:15.790
and stay away otherwise?

31:15.790 --> 31:16.480
I did text you,

31:16.480 --> 31:17.680
but you didn't reply.

31:18.970 --> 31:20.770
I was a bit busy the past few days.

31:20.800 --> 31:21.800
I understand.

31:22.210 --> 31:23.760
You seniors are busy.

31:23.920 --> 31:25.380
I completely understand.

31:25.590 --> 31:26.550
I came in person,

31:26.680 --> 31:28.740
so you wouldn't have to make the trip.

31:29.070 --> 31:30.130
Where is the money?

31:32.520 --> 31:34.120
Can you give me a few more days

31:34.980 --> 31:37.010
this month?

31:39.940 --> 31:40.660
Sure.

31:41.920 --> 31:43.030
Sure.

31:43.830 --> 31:44.590
I'm not an

31:44.590 --> 31:46.030
unreasonable person.

31:48.160 --> 31:49.160
However,

31:50.620 --> 31:51.620
the price goes up.

31:53.410 --> 31:54.510
I cover for you

31:54.510 --> 31:55.460
in front of my boss.

31:55.460 --> 31:57.000
Even if there's no merit,
there's hard work, right?

31:57.000 --> 31:58.030
Wouldn't you agree?

31:58.030 --> 31:58.640
Right.

31:58.670 --> 32:01.470
Raising it by a thousand or so
isn't too much, is it?

32:02.890 --> 32:03.830
Aren't you afraid I'll

32:03.830 --> 32:04.650
go to your boss

32:04.680 --> 32:06.480
and tell him you take kickbacks?

32:08.980 --> 32:10.620
Go ahead.

32:10.700 --> 32:11.410
Sure.

32:15.110 --> 32:16.200
It's just that,

32:17.310 --> 32:18.510
Fen probably doesn't know

32:18.510 --> 32:19.680
the house she lives in

32:19.680 --> 32:21.880
isn't at the same price as ten years ago.

32:22.640 --> 32:24.550
And she probably doesn't know

32:24.590 --> 32:26.830
that the good granddaughter

32:26.830 --> 32:28.680
she worked so hard to raise

32:28.680 --> 32:29.830
is secretly

32:30.560 --> 32:33.250
working outside

32:33.510 --> 32:34.920
to subsidize the family,

32:34.950 --> 32:35.830
and lying,

32:35.850 --> 32:37.200
and deceiving people.

32:39.190 --> 32:40.020
If the old lady knew,

32:40.020 --> 32:41.380
could her body handle it?

32:41.380 --> 32:42.840
Can you handle it, Xu Feng?

32:42.840 --> 32:43.600
I can't.

32:43.620 --> 32:44.370
Can you handle it?

32:44.370 --> 32:45.120
I can't.

32:46.690 --> 32:48.150
What are you trying to say?

32:49.950 --> 32:50.640
Zhou Wan,

32:52.770 --> 32:53.640
you

32:55.060 --> 32:56.190
are smart.

32:57.700 --> 32:58.800
But being smart

32:59.880 --> 33:01.540
can't take you away from here.

33:03.440 --> 33:05.280
So those little schemes

33:05.310 --> 33:06.160
and tricks of yours,

33:06.160 --> 33:07.530
don't try to use them on me,

33:07.530 --> 33:10.190
and don't even think about
negotiating with me.

33:19.610 --> 33:20.280
Fen,

33:21.110 --> 33:22.000
it's been a long time.

33:22.000 --> 33:22.920
I'll go up and say hi.

33:22.920 --> 33:23.350
Right.

33:24.710 --> 33:25.770
What are you doing?

33:26.840 --> 33:28.170
Why are you stopping me?

33:31.310 --> 33:33.750
I have to be quick to say hi,

33:34.420 --> 33:35.240
after all, she's

33:35.240 --> 33:36.610
a dying old lady.

33:38.130 --> 33:38.560
What?

33:38.590 --> 33:39.370
If you dare say that again,

33:39.370 --> 33:40.900
you won't get a single dime.

33:42.970 --> 33:44.570
Why are you looking at me like that?

33:44.570 --> 33:45.670
Do you hate me?

33:46.070 --> 33:48.060
Hating me is useless.

33:48.610 --> 33:50.120
It was your dad who did business,

33:50.120 --> 33:52.050
lost money, and became a deadbeat.

33:52.670 --> 33:53.940
Her mother ran away with someone else.

33:53.940 --> 33:54.890
Her dad is gone too.

33:54.890 --> 33:55.890
Isn't that right?

33:55.910 --> 33:57.050
Now it's just you and an old lady
left here,

33:57.050 --> 33:57.960
all alone and struggling.

33:57.960 --> 33:59.380
You blame me? You hate me?

34:00.190 --> 34:01.650
It won't change anything.

34:02.150 --> 34:02.950
Just useless.

34:08.639 --> 34:09.909
I will be back.

34:16.210 --> 34:17.940
Have the money ready next time.

34:19.120 --> 34:19.679
Let's go.

34:20.949 --> 34:21.590
Let's go.

34:36.920 --> 34:38.580
It's so late; where did you go?

34:42.030 --> 34:42.960
Jiang Yan lent me

34:42.960 --> 34:43.980
some of his study materials.

34:43.980 --> 34:45.239
I returned them to him.

34:46.030 --> 34:48.030
Doesn't he usually come to get them?

34:48.670 --> 34:49.440
Yeah.

34:50.560 --> 34:52.750
I just happened to go downstairs
to take out the trash today,

34:52.750 --> 34:54.239
so I told him not to come.

34:56.520 --> 34:58.530
So you went to take out the trash?

35:02.030 --> 35:04.890
Luo He hasn't caused you
any trouble lately, has he?

35:07.040 --> 35:08.840
How would he dare?

35:08.870 --> 35:10.050
It's good that he doesn't dare.

35:10.050 --> 35:10.920
If he does,

35:10.920 --> 35:12.600
you must tell Grandma.

35:12.620 --> 35:14.300
I might not be able to deal with others,

35:14.300 --> 35:16.120
but dealing with him?
That's not me bragging—

35:16.120 --> 35:18.040
when I was young, I really trained.

35:18.040 --> 35:19.930
Swords, spears, halberds,
axes, hooks, forks,

35:19.930 --> 35:21.420
staffs, maces…

35:21.450 --> 35:22.710
Anything with a blade,

35:22.710 --> 35:24.190
anything with spikes—

35:24.190 --> 35:25.640
you practiced them all.

35:25.670 --> 35:26.150
I know.

35:26.170 --> 35:26.900
You know?

35:26.930 --> 35:28.330
So with just one move—

35:28.360 --> 35:29.190
whoosh!

35:30.380 --> 35:31.790
I haven't finished yet.

35:36.290 --> 35:37.790
It should be fine now.

35:56.220 --> 35:57.410
Did you hear, Wan?

35:58.460 --> 35:59.580
Hear about what?

35:59.610 --> 36:00.610
About Lu Xixiao.

36:01.070 --> 36:02.670
In such a short time,

36:02.670 --> 36:04.370
he made it to the top 1,000 list.

36:04.370 --> 36:05.370
How did he do that?

36:06.260 --> 36:07.530
He's truly a genius.

36:24.920 --> 36:32.010
[TOEFL Vocabulary Selection]

36:40.440 --> 36:41.840
Give me back my keychain.

36:48.260 --> 36:49.690
Don't tell me you lost it.

37:11.810 --> 37:12.670
Grandma Huang,

37:12.690 --> 37:15.330
your condition hasn't been
very well controlled recently.

37:15.330 --> 37:16.670
I don't have any major problems.

37:16.670 --> 37:18.810
I'll just go home and take care of it.

37:18.830 --> 37:21.110
Dr. Chen, don't listen to her.

37:21.410 --> 37:21.930
Well...

37:22.960 --> 37:24.910
Your blood sugar is very high this time.

37:24.910 --> 37:25.710
How about we do

37:25.730 --> 37:26.790
a systematic test?

37:26.830 --> 37:27.750
No need. Look,

37:27.770 --> 37:29.360
do I look like I'm sick?

37:29.380 --> 37:31.260
Don't waste money on tests.

37:31.290 --> 37:32.060
Let's go home.

37:32.060 --> 37:32.560
Let's go.

37:32.560 --> 37:34.390
All right, we won't do the test.

37:35.150 --> 37:36.480
You came at a good time today.

37:36.480 --> 37:37.550
Our hospital is giving seniors

37:37.550 --> 37:39.010
free eggs.

37:39.040 --> 37:39.950
Go and get some.

37:40.500 --> 37:41.900
Okay, you talk to him.

37:41.920 --> 37:43.310
I'll go get the eggs.

37:43.610 --> 37:44.440
I'm lucky today

37:44.440 --> 37:45.810
to get free eggs.

37:45.830 --> 37:47.280
I can go play cards later.

37:48.270 --> 37:49.030
I'll wait for you there.

37:49.030 --> 37:49.710
Okay, the prescription

37:49.710 --> 37:50.880
will be handled by Wan.

37:50.880 --> 37:51.510
Okay.

37:51.510 --> 37:52.710
Don't wander too far.

37:57.330 --> 37:59.130
Her condition is not very ideal.

38:02.820 --> 38:03.710
Are there any drugs

38:03.710 --> 38:04.960
with better efficacy?

38:04.960 --> 38:06.960
Then we can only try imported drugs.

38:07.080 --> 38:08.420
But they are very expensive.

38:08.420 --> 38:09.030
And they are not

38:09.030 --> 38:10.690
covered by health insurance.

38:10.760 --> 38:11.510
How much?

38:12.190 --> 38:13.190
1,500 per box.

38:13.530 --> 38:14.570
Two boxes a month.

38:19.290 --> 38:20.310
Let's change to that.

38:20.310 --> 38:21.980
That's not a small burden

38:22.780 --> 38:23.560
for your family.

38:23.560 --> 38:24.760
I will have the money.

38:26.810 --> 38:29.120
Okay, I'll prescribe it for you.

38:33.020 --> 38:34.150
Thank you, Dr. Chen.

38:43.620 --> 38:47.380
[Contact] [Guo Yan]

38:55.440 --> 38:56.280
Mom!

38:56.360 --> 38:57.110
Mom!

38:58.590 --> 39:00.030
Mom!

39:00.190 --> 39:01.840
Am I not a good girl?

39:01.840 --> 39:03.360
Is that why Dad doesn't want me,

39:03.360 --> 39:04.920
and neither do you?

39:05.160 --> 39:06.560
I can stop eating snacks,

39:06.590 --> 39:07.550
go to bed early,

39:07.550 --> 39:08.590
and wash my own clothes.

39:08.590 --> 39:09.840
Go back now!

39:10.240 --> 39:11.070
Mom,

39:11.070 --> 39:15.230
can you please not leave me behind?

39:17.870 --> 39:19.850
Mom!

39:21.960 --> 39:23.630
Mom!

39:52.590 --> 39:53.630
Ms. Zhou,

39:53.970 --> 39:55.960
I think

39:56.530 --> 39:57.700
it is a bit too early

39:58.870 --> 40:00.670
for you to make money at your age.

40:03.560 --> 40:04.480
I already know

40:05.480 --> 40:06.740
about your situation.

40:09.030 --> 40:10.750
When choosing a teacher for our child,

40:10.750 --> 40:11.630
we definitely have to

40:11.630 --> 40:12.710
ask around.

40:13.480 --> 40:14.250
I know

40:14.330 --> 40:16.390
you must have your own difficulties.

40:16.810 --> 40:19.710
However, lying

40:19.960 --> 40:21.440
is really not good.

40:22.590 --> 40:24.330
And you are currently in your senior year.

40:24.330 --> 40:25.290
You should focus

40:25.610 --> 40:27.270
on the college entrance exam.

40:32.030 --> 40:33.070
Ms. Zhou.

40:33.320 --> 40:33.840
Well...

40:53.000 --> 40:54.670
Xixiao, wait for me.

40:54.670 --> 40:55.880
Don't you have anything else to do

40:55.880 --> 40:57.070
besides following me every day,

40:57.070 --> 40:57.930
Guo Xiangling?

40:58.810 --> 41:00.710
Your motorcycle was confiscated
by the teacher.

41:00.710 --> 41:01.860
Do you want me to help you

41:01.860 --> 41:02.570
get it back?

41:02.630 --> 41:03.880
Don't worry about it.

41:03.880 --> 41:05.280
I've already handled it.

41:06.110 --> 41:07.710
Tell me if you need anything.

41:07.710 --> 41:08.840
I can help you.

41:09.030 --> 41:10.460
Otherwise, if your dad finds out,

41:10.460 --> 41:11.460
it won't be good.

41:11.490 --> 41:13.020
Do you think we are the same?

41:13.570 --> 41:14.830
Do I need to please him?

41:17.130 --> 41:19.130
[Guo Yan]

41:27.130 --> 41:28.600
[Slide to answer]

41:30.720 --> 41:31.840
What do you mean by pleasing?

41:31.840 --> 41:33.030
I'm trying to help you.

41:33.030 --> 41:34.280
Save this trick for my dad.

41:34.280 --> 41:35.140
Guo Xiangling.

41:56.540 --> 41:58.610
Why is Guo Yan with him?

42:00.810 --> 42:01.830
Lu Xixiao!

42:04.270 --> 42:05.600
Where did you come from?

42:07.560 --> 42:08.690
Are you stalking me?

42:08.690 --> 42:09.890
Was that lady just now

42:11.010 --> 42:12.290
your mother?

42:16.550 --> 42:17.400
No.

42:18.570 --> 42:19.370
What's wrong?

42:22.800 --> 42:23.550
Nothing.

42:27.870 --> 42:30.100
[TOEFL Vocabulary Selection]

42:37.510 --> 42:39.460
Are you going abroad?

42:43.730 --> 42:44.660
How did you know?

42:50.880 --> 42:52.540
Monday at the abandoned pool.

42:53.890 --> 42:54.760
I have something

42:54.760 --> 42:55.890
to talk to you about.

43:11.540 --> 43:12.510
Lu Xixiao,

43:13.090 --> 43:15.350
none of this was supposed to involve you.

43:15.650 --> 43:16.340
I'm sorry.
